<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28306" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĕdĭānus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		medius, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that is in the middle, middle</i> (except Vitr.,
			only post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">columnae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					3, 2, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acroteria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					3, 5, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capita leonina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					3, 5, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">digitus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 2, 40, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">filius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 73, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Fabr. 463, 95</span></i>
			.— <i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĕdĭānum</span></b> ,
				i, n., <i>the middle
				part, the middle</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex mediano coenaculi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 9, 3, 5, § 2</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mediana malvarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Apic. 4, 2, 133</span></i>
			.</div>
